<title>USA: ZEBRA FILES FOR SECONDARY OFFERING.</title>
<headline>ZEBRA FILES FOR SECONDARY OFFERING.</headline>
<dateline>VERNON HILLS, Ill. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zebra Technologies Corp said Monday it has filed for a proposed secondary offering of 2,056,344 shares of Class A common stock.</p>
<p>All of the shares in the offering are currently outstanding. The shares are being sold by certain senior executive officers of the company and their families, Zebra said.</p>
<p>Zebra provides bar-code labeling solutions, principally to manufacturing and service entities.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
